WEBVTT

00:02:29.559 --> 00:02:31.750
(Music)

00:02:31.774 --> 00:02:34.258
Thanks to Hilton
for sponsoring this episode.

00:02:34.282 --> 00:02:41.282
(Music)

00:02:44.736 --> 00:02:45.886
(Music fades out)

00:02:45.910 --> 00:02:48.246
Procrastination
is intentionally delaying a task

00:02:48.270 --> 00:02:49.496
that needs to be done

00:02:49.520 --> 00:02:52.356
even though you know
it will come with a cost.

00:02:52.380 --> 00:02:53.546
Instead of working,

00:02:53.570 --> 00:02:56.836
you might find yourself
watching cat videos on YouTube,

00:02:56.860 --> 00:02:58.068
looking in your fridge

00:02:58.092 --> 00:03:01.436
to see if something new has magically
appeared in the last 10 minutes,